  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "甘味が　ある　食材。たまねぎと　比較して　辛味や香りが　穏やかで　食べやすい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "단맛이 나는 식재료. 양파에 비해 매운맛이나 향이 강하지 않아서 먹기 좋다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "帶有甜味的食材。辣味和氣味較洋蔥溫和，容易入口。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût sucré. Il est plus doux et moins âcre que les autres oignons, ce qui lui permet de satisfaire la plupart des palais.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diese süßliche Zutat zeichnet sich im Vergleich zu gewöhnlichen Zwiebeln durch milde Schärfe und mildes Aroma aus, wodurch sie sich leichter verspeisen lässt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Comparada con otros tipos de cebolla, la fragancia y el picante de esta variante dulzona son mucho más suaves, por lo que se deja comer mejor.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente dolce. Si lascia mangiare più facilmente della Cipolla bianca grazie all’aroma e la piccantezza meno marcati.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An ingredient with some sweetness to it. Its spiciness and fragrance are milder than those of other onions, making it a pleasant bite.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "甘味が　ある　食材。たまねぎと　比較して　辛味や香りが　穏やかで　食べやすい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "带有甜味的食材。与洋葱相比，辣味和香味都较淡，容易入口。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
